    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Defy Death for Profane Power</p></blockquote><p>You have made a pact with a creature that defies the cycle of life and death: a powerful lich, a vampire, or another entity of undeath. Once mortal themselves, these ancient patrons know firsthand the paths of ambition and the ways past the doors of death. They eagerly share this profane knowledge and other secrets with those who do their will among the living.</p><h3>Undead Patron Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Qw0WJ4WNx9OfRicG]{Form of Dread}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.81F44frcchwQ1vU5]{Undead Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.C7RZ363FN6Jm4qLv]{Grave Touched}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.3ZZJwuqJlBzLhHaz]{Necrotic Husk}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.E5ID8N8PY1nmbyLw]{Superior Dread}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Undead Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBane000000]{Bane}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlindnessD]{Blindness/Deafness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbPhantasmalFor]{Phantasmal Force}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRayofSickn]{Ray of Sickness}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSpeakwithD]{Speak with Dead}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.EX24QkNdCeUOAeeV]{Summon Undead}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPhantasmal]{Phantasmal Killer}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAntilifeSh]{Antilife Shell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCloudkill0]{Cloudkill}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
